{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46273","headline":"句 · 贯休","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日再三难更识，谶辞唯道待钱来。\n鴈荡经行云漠漠，龙湫宴坐雨蒙蒙。\n刻成筝柱鴈相挨。\n黄昏风雨黑如磐，别我不知何处去。\n郭尚父休夸塞北，裴中令莫说淮西。\n万计交人买，华轩保惜深。\n如何忠爲主，至竟不封侯。\n但看千骑去，知有几人归。\n一生不蓄买田钱，华屋何心亦偶然。\n客至多逢僧在坐，钓归惟许鹤随船。\n家爲买琴添旧价，厨因养鹤减晨炊。\n黏粉爲题栖凤竹，带香因洗落花泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}